# Changelog maintenance

After completing any task that changes product behaviour, add one line to the
**active changelog file** in the matching section.

## Active file

While repo root `version` is `X.Y.Z`, edit **only**:

```
changelog/onedrop-changelog-v<NEXT>
```

where `<NEXT>` is the semver after one bump. So `version` = `1.0.0` means
you edit `changelog/onedrop-changelog-v1.0.1`, never `-v1.0.0`. After `1.0.9`
the next file is `onedrop-changelog-v1.1.0`, never `v1.0.10`.

Keep three sections in this order: Features, Improvements, Bug fixes.

```
[type] Short user-facing summary
```

Types are `feature`, `bugfix` and `improvement`. English only.
